## Claude Code stack (agent-routing-kit)

- Features: `/model-routing:plan <goal>` → review → `/model-routing:build`. Small changes: just do them.
- Test: `<cmd>` · Lint: `<cmd>` · Typecheck: `<cmd>`
- Always risk R=2 (minimum T2 + security review): `src/auth/**`, `src/billing/**`, `migrations/**`, `infra/**`, `*.tf`, `Dockerfile*`, `.github/workflows/**`
